<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>CRIST AI Command Centre | Beast Mode</title>
    <!-- Fonts & Icons -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* ==========================================================================
           CRIST MOTORS ULTRA-PREMIUM OBSIDIAN DESIGN SYSTEM (NO PURPLE / NO GOLD)
           ========================================================================== */
        :root {
            --bg-obsidian: #05070a;
            --bg-deep-navy: #090d16;
            --bg-panel: rgba(13, 19, 31, 0.75);
            --bg-panel-solid: #0e1420;
            --border-titanium: rgba(180, 195, 210, 0.18);
            --border-glow: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.4);
            
            --electric-blue: #00a2ff;
            --electric-blue-glow: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.25);
            --titanium-silver: #c8d6e5;
            --metallic-grey: #485460;
            --pure-white: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #8395a7;
            --danger-red: #ff3f34;
            --warning-amber: #ff9f1a;
            --success-green: #05c46b;

            --font-display: 'Cinzel', serif;
            --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            
            --panel-blur: blur(20px);
            --transition-smooth: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-obsidian);
            color: var(--titanium-silver);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            user-select: none;
        }

        /* Ambient Dynamic VFX Canvas Background */
        #vfx-canvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* App Shell Layout */
        .app-shell {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: flex;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.08), transparent 70%);
        }

        /* Sidebar Navigation */
        .sidebar {
            width: 280px;
            background: rgba(7, 10, 17, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: var(--panel-blur);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            z-index: 10;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
        }

        .brand-header {
            padding: 24px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--electric-blue), #0044ff);
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--electric-blue-glow);
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--pure-white);
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--electric-blue);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .nav-menu {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 16px 12px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .nav-section-title {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--metallic-grey);
            padding: 12px 12px 6px 12px;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .nav-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .nav-item:hover {
            color: var(--pure-white);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .nav-item.active {
            color: var(--pure-white);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.15), transparent);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--electric-blue);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .nav-item i {
            width: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .system-status-bar {
            padding: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            background: rgba(5, 7, 10, 0.5);
        }

        .status-indicator {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--success-green);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success-green);
            animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-dot {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); }
        }

        /* Main Workspace Content Area */
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Top Bar Header */
        .top-header {
            height: 64px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            background: rgba(9, 13, 22, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: var(--panel-blur);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .page-header-title {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--pure-white);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .badge-mode {
            background: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--electric-blue);
            color: var(--electric-blue);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .header-controls {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .btn-action {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            color: var(--titanium-silver);
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-action:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.15);
            border-color: var(--electric-blue);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--electric-blue-glow);
        }

        /* Dynamic Module Container */
        .view-container {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .module-view {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }

        .module-view.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Cards & Panels (Titanium Glassmorphic) */
        .grid-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card-panel {
            background: var(--bg-panel);
            backdrop-filter: var(--panel-blur);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37);
        }

        .card-panel::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-titanium), transparent);
        }

        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--pure-white);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .card-title i {
            color: var(--electric-blue);
        }

        /* Metric Widgets */
        .metric-value {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .metric-sub {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .metric-sub.highlight {
            color: var(--electric-blue);
        }

        /* Custom Vector Graphics / SVG Data Charts */
        .chart-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            position: relative;
        }

        svg.sparkline {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: visible;
        }

        .sparkline-path {
            fill: none;
            stroke: var(--electric-blue);
            stroke-width: 2.5;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            filter: drop-shadow(0px 4px 8px rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.5));
        }

        .sparkline-area {
            fill: url(#blue-gradient);
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        /* Execution / Approval Stream Items */
        .approval-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .approval-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--warning-amber);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 14px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .approval-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .approval-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--pure-white);
        }

        .approval-desc {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .approval-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 6px;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .btn-approve {
            background: rgba(5, 196, 107, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--success-green);
            color: var(--success-green);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
        }

        .btn-approve:hover {
            background: var(--success-green);
            color: var(--bg-obsidian);
        }

        .btn-reject {
            background: rgba(255, 63, 52, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--danger-red);
            color: var(--danger-red);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
        }

        .btn-reject:hover {
            background: var(--danger-red);
            color: var(--pure-white);
        }

        /* AI Chat Module Layout */
        .chat-container-layout {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: calc(100vh - 112px);
            background: var(--bg-panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .chat-messages {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .message-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            max-width: 85%;
        }

        .message-row.user {
            align-self: flex-end;
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .avatar.ai {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--electric-blue), #0044ff);
            color: var(--pure-white);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--electric-blue-glow);
        }

        .avatar.user {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            color: var(--titanium-silver);
        }

        .message-bubble {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: var(--titanium-silver);
        }

        .message-row.user .message-bubble {
            background: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.3);
            color: var(--pure-white);
        }

        .message-header {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--electric-blue);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .chat-input-area {
            padding: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            background: rgba(5, 7, 10, 0.8);
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .chat-input {
            flex: 1;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-titanium);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            color: var(--pure-white);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
        }

        .chat-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--electric-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--electric-blue-glow);
        }

        .btn-send {
            background: var(--electric-blue);
            color: var(--bg-obsidian);
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-send:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--electric-blue);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Mobile Optimization Rules */
        .mobile-toggle {
            display: none;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--pure-white);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .sidebar {
                position: fixed;
                left: -280px;
                top: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                box-shadow: 10px 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            }

            .sidebar.mobile-open {
                left: 0;
            }

            .mobile-toggle {
                display: block;
            }

            .grid-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .card-panel {
                grid-column: span 12 !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Ambient Canvas Background -->
    <canvas id="vfx-canvas"></canvas>

    <!-- Main Shell Container -->
    <div class="app-shell">

        <!-- Navigation Sidebar -->
        <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
            <div class="brand-header">
                <div class="brand-logo">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-title">CRIST AI</div>
                    <div class="brand-subtitle">Command Centre</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <nav class="nav-menu">
                <div class="nav-section-title">Core Operations</div>
                <a class="nav-item active" onclick="switchModule('overview')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> Executive Overview
                </a>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('ai-chat')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i> AI Co-Founder Chat
                </a>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('strategy')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chess"></i> Strategy & Roadmap
                </a>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('approvals')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-stamp"></i> Approval Centre
                </a>

                <div class="nav-section-title">R&D / Automotive</div>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('gt01')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-car-side"></i> GT-01 Programme
                </a>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('tech-lab')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> CRIST Chip Research
                </a>

                <div class="nav-section-title">Governance</div>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('finance')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-vault"></i> Financial Scenarios
                </a>
                <a class="nav-item" onclick="switchModule('security')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Security & Logs
                </a>
            </nav>

            <div class="system-status-bar">
                <div class="status-indicator">
                    <div class="status-dot"></div>
                    <span>BEAST MODE ACTIVE</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Workspace -->
        <main class="main-content">

            <!-- Top Header Control Bar -->
            <header class="top-header">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
                    <button class="mobile-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar()">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
                    </button>
                    <div class="page-header-title" id="module-title">
                        Executive Overview <span class="badge-mode">v2.0 PRO</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="header-controls">
                    <button class="btn-action" onclick="switchModule('ai-chat')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i> Command Terminal
                    </button>
                </div>
            </header>

            <!-- Dynamic View Containers -->
            <div class="view-container">

                <!-- 1. Executive Overview Module -->
                <div class="module-view active" id="view-overview">
                    <div class="grid-layout">
                        <!-- Stat Card 1 -->
                        <div class="card-panel" style="grid-column: span 4;">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <span class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i> Programme Stage</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="metric-value">CONCEPT</div>
                            <div class="metric-sub highlight">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Design Specs Formulating
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Stat Card 2 -->
                        <div class="card-panel" style="grid-column: span 4;">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <span class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> System Load</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="metric-value">0.04 ms</div>
                            <div class="metric-sub">
                                Cloudflare Worker Proxy Active
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Stat Card 3 -->
                        <div class="card-panel" style="grid-column: span 4;">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <span class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat"></i> Approval Queue</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="metric-value" id="overview-pending-count">2 Pending</div>
                            <div class="metric-sub" style="color: var(--warning-amber);">
                                Requires Co-Founder Verification
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Main Graphic Visualization Panel -->
                        <div class="card-panel" style="grid-column: span 8;">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <span class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-area"></i> Development Capital Burn vs Target Run-Rate</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="chart-container">
                                <svg class="sparkline" viewBox="0 0 500 150">
                                    <defs>
                                        <linearGradient id="blue-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                                            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00a2ff" stop-opacity="0.4"/>
                                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#00a2ff" stop-opacity="0.0"/>
                                        </linearGradient>
                                    </defs>
                                    <path class="sparkline-area" d="M 0,130 L 0,100 Q 100,20 200,80 T 400,30 L 500,60 L 500,150 L 0,150 Z" />
                                    <path class="sparkline-path" d="M 0,100 Q 100,20 200,80 T 400,30 L 500,60" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Critical Strategic Logs Panel -->
                        <div class="card-panel" style="grid-column: span 4;">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <span class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i> Verified Reality Check</span>
                            </div>
                            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--titanium-silver);">
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Fact:</strong> No physical prototype vehicle currently exists.</p>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Fact:</strong> GT-01 powertrains are under active feasibility study.</p>
                                <p><strong>Rule:</strong> No external commitments execute without human approval.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. AI Chat Module -->
                <div class="module-view" id="view-ai-chat">
                    <div class="chat-container-layout">
                        <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages">
                            <div class="message-row">
                                <div class="avatar ai">AI</div>
                                <div class="message-bubble">
                                    <div class="message-header">
                                        <span>CRIST BEAST MODE CO-FOUNDER</span>
                                        <span>SYSTEM ONLINE</span>
                                    </div>
                                    Greetings. I am fully initialized. Standing by to assist with GT-01 strategy, structural financial modeling, or technical architecture analysis. How shall we proceed?
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="chat-input-area">
                            <input type="text" class="chat-input" id="chat-input" placeholder="Enter executive directive or strategic inquiry..." onkeypress="handleKeyPress(event)">
                            <button class="btn-send" onclick="sendMessage()">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Send
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Strategy & Roadmap Module -->
                <div class="module-view" id="view-strategy">
